{"text": "Saturday morning came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the whole summer world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was bright and fresh. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a song. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In every heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the trees were full of flowers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom came out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Onto the sidewalk with a bucket of whitewash. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a long brush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked at the fence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And all the joy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Left him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was thirty yards. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of board fence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nine feet high. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Life seemed empty to him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And living was a heavy burden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sighing he dipped his brush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And passed it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Along the top board. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he compared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The small white line. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With the huge fence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sat down on a box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Feeling hopeless.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "a", "t", "u", "r", "d", "a", "y", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", "l", "e", " ", "s", "u", "m", "m", "e", "r", " ", "w", "o", "r", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "a", "s", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "r", "e", "s", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "s", "o", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i",